{
  "ruleId": "DED-WITHIN-GROSS-TOTAL",
  "_note": "\"The aggregate amount of the deductions under this Chapter shall not, in any case, exceed the gross total income of the assessee\" (s.122(2), p.158); \"gross total income\" is the total income before Chapter VIII (s.122(10), p.159). Every regime: what the new regime keeps of Chapter VIII is bound too. TY 2026-27 only (D-129 C2a). rulebook DED-GTI-CAP-001, -DEF-001. Its 1961 counterpart is not mapped in the design and is unread (W-075d).",
